{
  "$format": "janus-conformance-case/1",
  "id": "facade/pact-js-request-bodies",
  "category": "facade",
  "facade": "pact-js",
  "title": "Each request body the V4 builder takes, and its matching rules, is served as the test sends it and recorded as its pact converts.",
  "covers": [],
  "rows": [
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`withRequest(method, path, builder)`: `query`, `headers`, `jsonBody`, `xmlBody`, `binaryFile`, `body`, `matchingRules`"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`matchingRules(rules)` and PactV3's `with*MatchingRules`"
    }
  ],
  "why": "consumer-test-migration.md, pact-js: `withRequest(method, path, builder)` with `query`, `headers`, `jsonBody`, `xmlBody`, `binaryFile`, `body` and `matchingRules` is kept: the same calls. `matchingRules(rules)` is converted as a pact's rules at those paths are.",
  "note": "`query` and `headers` are facade/pact-js-http-interaction's. A type rule on an XML element's text records no constraint on it, as `janus upgrade` converts pact-js's own XML example.",
  "subjects": { "typescript": "pact-js-request-bodies.ts" },
  "expect": {
    "tests": [
      { "test": "jsonBody" },
      { "test": "xmlBody" },
      { "test": "binaryFile" },
      { "test": "body" },
      { "test": "matchingRules" }
    ],
    "contracts": {
      "web-app-orders-api.janus.json": {
        "content": {
          "interactions": [
            {
              "description": "create an order from JSON",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": {
                      "sku": { "example": "A-1", "shape": "type" },
                      "quantity": { "example": 2, "shape": "integer" }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/json",
                            "example": "application/json"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/orders", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "create an order from XML",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": {
                      "order": {
                        "members": {
                          "#trimmed": { "shape": "forbidden" },
                          "sku": { "entries": [{ "members": {}, "shape": "object" }], "shape": "array" }
                        },
                        "shape": "object"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/xml",
                            "example": "application/xml"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/orders", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "create an order from text",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": { "content-type": "text/plain", "example": "sku=A-1", "shape": "content-type" },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [{ "shape": "http:media-type", "type": "text/plain", "example": "text/plain" }],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/orders", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "create an order with rules",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": {
                    "members": { "sku": { "example": "A-1", "pattern": "^(?:^[A-Z]-\\d+$)$", "shape": "regex" } },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/json",
                            "example": "application/json"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/orders", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "upload a receipt file",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "body": {
                    "content-type": "application/pdf",
                    "encoded": "base64",
                    "example": "JVBERi0xLjQgYSByZWNlaXB0",
                    "shape": "content-type"
                  },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/pdf",
                            "example": "application/pdf"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "method": { "example": "POST", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/receipts", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 201, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
